        "text_j6gYJr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Construction is one of Australia’s most high-risk industries, where safety lapses can have serious—or even fatal—consequences. In fact, construction consistently ranks among the top industries for workplace injuries and fatalities, often linked to impairment on the job.<br/><br/>That’s why implementing a reliable drug and alcohol testing program isn’t just about ticking a compliance box—it’s about protecting lives, reducing downtime, and building a safety-first culture on-site.<br/><br/>At Andatech, we provide the tools and support to help construction companies of all sizes manage risk, stay compliant, and keep their teams safe. From high-accuracy breathalysers to rapid drug screening kits, our solutions make it easier to identify impairment and make informed decisions—before incidents occur.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
